scription&quot;: &quot;Pathway: a UB Curriculum Thematic or Global Pathway course - part of at least four UB Areas/SUNY General Education categories a student&#x27;s Pathways coursework must satisfy across two Pathways (one Thematic, one Global).&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.buffalo.edu/ubcurriculum/pathways.html&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag box-ubc-tag\">UB Curriculum</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Pathway</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-generic\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-1-2-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;ubc&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Pathway: a UB Curriculum Thematic or Global Pathway course - part of at least four UB Areas/SUNY General Education categories a student&#x27;s Pathways coursework must satisfy across two Pathways (one Thematic, one Global).&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.buffalo.edu/ubcurriculum/pathways.html&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag box-ubc-tag\">UB Curriculum</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Pathway</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-generic\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-1-3-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;ubc&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Scientific Literacy and Inquiry: a 7-credit UB Curriculum Foundations requirement (two lecture courses plus a matching 1-credit lab from the same subject area).&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.buffalo.edu/ubcurriculum/foundations.html&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag box-ubc-tag\">UB Curriculum</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Scientific Literacy 2</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-generic\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-1-4-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;ubc&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Scientific Literacy and Inquiry: a 7-credit UB Curriculum Foundations requirement (two lecture courses plus a matching 1-credit lab from the same subject area).&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.buffalo.edu/ubcurriculum/foundations.html&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag box-ubc-tag\">UB Curriculum</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Scientific Lab</div><span class=\"box-credits\">1 cr</span></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"col-total\">14 credits</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"semester-col term-fall\">\n        <div class=\"col-header\"><span class=\"col-year\">Year 2</span><span class=\"col-term\">Fall</span></div>\n        <div class=\"col-slots\"><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-course\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-2-0-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;course&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Understanding Media Study&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;An introduction to the historical development of media in modern culture, this course will expose students to a range of critical accounts of photography, film, recorded sound, print, television, video, and new media. We will examine the material and aesthetic components that define various media as well as the political, social, and economic functions that media serve. Lectures, screenings, and discussions will be structured by major theoretical texts and approaches drawn from the humanities disciplines of film and media studies, critical theory, and cultural studies. This course will demonstrate the foundational role of media in the construction of Western civilization, concepts of the global, and contemporary life around the world. It will also provide a solid theoretical basis for all forms of media study, including both production and analysis.&quot;, &quot;credits&quot;: &quot;3&quot;, &quot;grading&quot;: &quot;Graded (GRD)&quot;, &quot;typically_offered&quot;: &quot;Fall, Summer&quot;, &quot;requisites&quot;: null, &quot;flexible&quot;: false, &quot;also_ubc&quot;: false}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-label\"><span class=\"box-code\">DMS 259SEM</span><span class=\"box-title\">Understanding Media Study</span></div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-course box-flexible\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-2-1-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;major_requirement&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;\\&quot;Breadth Course\\&quot; is a flexible requirement slot defined by this major&#x27;s own requirements, not a specific course - see the Undergraduate Catalog for the exact eligible options.&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://catalogs.buffalo.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=21&amp;poid=8193&amp;returnto=1177&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag\">Requirement in the major</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Breadth Course</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-course box-flexible\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-2-2-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;major_elective&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;\\&quot;LAS Elective\\&quot; is an elective slot specific to this major&#x27;s own requirements, not a UB Curriculum-wide component - the exact eligible courses depend on this program&#x27;s requirements as listed in the Undergraduate Catalog.&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://catalogs.buffalo.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=21&amp;poid=8193&amp;returnto=1177&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag\">Elective in the major</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">LAS Elective</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-generic\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-2-3-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;ubc&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Pathway: a UB Curriculum Thematic or Global Pathway course - part of at least four UB Areas/SUNY General Education categories a student&#x27;s Pathways coursework must satisfy across two Pathways (one Thematic, one Global).&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.buffalo.edu/ubcurriculum/pathways.html&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag box-ubc-tag\">UB Curriculum</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Pathway</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-generic\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-2-4-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;ubc&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Pathway: a UB Curriculum Thematic or Global Pathway course - part of at least four UB Areas/SUNY General Education categories a student&#x27;s Pathways coursework must satisfy across two Pathways (one Thematic, one Global).&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.buffalo.edu/ubcurriculum/pathways.html&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag box-ubc-tag\">UB Curriculum</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Pathway</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div></div>\n        <div class=\"col-total\">15 credits</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"semester-col term-spring\">\n        <div class=\"col-header\"><span class=\"col-year\">Year 2</span><span class=\"col-term\">Spring</span></div>\n        <div class=\"col-slots\"><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-course\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-3-0-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;course&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;PLASMA: Performance, Screenings, and Lectures in Media Art&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Performances, Lectures, and Screenings in Media Art (PLASMA) is a new speakers series in which students are exposed to contemporary practices and discourses in media art and culture. Beyond the model of a lecture series course, PLASMA engages students in performative, field-based and workshop encounters with professional practitioners operating at national and international levels of visibility. Six guests will visit the course throughout the semester, with alternating weeks providing an opportunity for critical reflection and discussion. Readings are assigned to complement topics addressed in the work of guest practitioners, including publications of their own, where relevant.&quot;, &quot;credits&quot;: &quot;3&quot;, &quot;grading&quot;: &quot;Graded&quot;, &quot;typically_offered&quot;: &quot;Spring&quot;, &quot;requisites&quot;: null, &quot;flexible&quot;: false, &quot;also_ubc&quot;: false}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-label\"><span class=\"box-code\">DMS 311LEC</span><span class=\"box-title\">PLASMA: Performance, Screenings, and Lectures in Media Art</span></div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-course box-flexible\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-3-1-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;generic&quot;, &quot;category&quot;: &quot;major_requirement&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;\\&quot;Advanced Analysis Course 1\\&quot; is a flexible requirement slot defined by this major&#x27;s own requirements, not a specific course - see the Undergraduate Catalog for the exact eligible options.&quot;, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://catalogs.buffalo.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=21&amp;poid=8193&amp;returnto=1177&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag\">Requirement in the major</span></div><div class=\"box-label\">Advanced Analysis Course 1</div><span class=\"box-credits\">3 cr</span></div></div><div class=\"slot\"><div class=\"box box-course box-flexible\" id=\"media-study-ba-critical-studies-concentration__box-3-2-0\" data-detail=\"{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;course&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Film Production 1&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;This course provides an introduction to the technical and aesthetic practice of video production and post-production, with a critical eye to both form and content. Through lectures, readings, exercises, and projects, as well as screenings of historical and contemporary film and video work, students will gain an understanding of film and video language and explore conceptual strategies for the development of creative approaches to digital video making.&quot;, &quot;credits&quot;: &quot;4&quot;, &quot;grading&quot;: &quot;Graded (GRD)&quot;, &quot;typically_offered&quot;: &quot;Fall, Spring&quot;, &quot;requisites&quot;: null, &quot;flexible&quot;: true, &quot;also_ubc&quot;: false, &quot;catalog_url&quot;: &quot;https://catalogs.buffalo.edu/preview_program.php?catoid=21&amp;poid=8193&amp;returnto=1177&quot;, &quot;groups&quot;: [{&quot;requirement_type&quot;: &quot;choice_required&quot;, &quot;group&quot;: &quot;Production (choose 1 of 2, 4 credits)&quot;, &quot;courses&quot;: [{&quot;code&quot;: &quot;DMS 103SEM&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Film Production 1&quot;}, {&quot;code&quot;: &quot;DMS 121SEM&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Basic Digital Arts&quot;}]}]}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"box-eyebrow\"><span class=\"box-eyebrow-tag\">full list on click</span></